## Interface: 30300
## Title: Rarity Borders
## Notes: Quality-colored borders, plus optional sparkles and comet trails (each an on/off switch) on items in bags, bank and character frame, with a red tint on items you cannot use. Works with Bagnon and ElvUI bags.
## Version: 2.2
## Author: ExOAte
## OptionalDeps: Bagnon, Bagnon_GuildBank, ElvUI
## SavedVariables: RarityBordersDB

